The files in this directory, except cloudflare-types.ts, are copied from
https://github.com/cloudflare/workers-sdk/tree/4a5377fc228dd94aa5df7545c8185cdd98be733e/packages/workflows-shared/src
(`@cloudflare/workflows-shared` 0.15.1, licensed MIT OR Apache-2.0). Orange uses them under
the MIT license below. Import lines point at Orange modules and
cloudflare-types.ts. Every other Orange change is marked with an "OPEN-ORANGE" comment.
Not copied: binding.ts (ported to ../binding.ts), introspection.ts, types.ts,
local-binding-worker.ts, index.ts, and the WorkflowInstanceModifier class.

